WEBVTT

01:30.230 --> 01:34.970
[The Heir]

01:35.470 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 19]

01:38.150 --> 01:39.610
In the next couple of days,

01:40.120 --> 01:42.650
I will go into the mountains
to find pine wood.

01:44.550 --> 01:48.210
I would like to ask you to return
to the ink workshop as the manager.

01:55.840 --> 01:56.970
Sixth Grandfather,

01:57.590 --> 01:59.789
I have little experience
and lack seniority.

01:59.789 --> 02:01.590
I cannot take on this responsibility.

02:01.590 --> 02:02.790
Please return.

02:07.310 --> 02:08.639
Although you are young,

02:10.150 --> 02:13.350
you managed to open your own ink workshop
all by yourself.

02:14.310 --> 02:15.970
With this kind of capability,

02:16.590 --> 02:17.840
I trust you.

02:17.840 --> 02:18.970
Sixth Grandfather,

02:19.800 --> 02:21.430
it's not about
whether you trust me or not.

02:21.430 --> 02:22.560
It's just that now,

02:23.310 --> 02:24.630
I cannot trust the Li family

02:24.630 --> 02:25.910
or Li Ink.

02:27.960 --> 02:29.520
About the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

02:29.520 --> 02:31.750
you were the ones
who kicked me out of the Li family.

02:31.750 --> 02:33.400
Now that the Li family is in trouble,

02:33.400 --> 02:35.520
you want me to go back and help.

02:35.960 --> 02:36.870
Don't you think

02:37.470 --> 02:39.150
it's ironic?

02:39.470 --> 02:40.520
I know

02:41.470 --> 02:44.430
that over the years, in the main family
and the ink workshop,

02:44.430 --> 02:46.890
you have suffered
a great deal of injustice.

02:47.190 --> 02:48.050
How about this?

02:48.560 --> 02:50.430
I apologize to you.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.710
Sixth Grandfather, what are you doing?

02:54.710 --> 02:56.030
Let's stick to the facts.

02:56.030 --> 02:57.120
If you do this,

02:57.470 --> 02:59.130
it's too much for me to accept.

03:04.310 --> 03:06.150
After Li Ink lost the right
to provide Tribute Ink,

03:06.150 --> 03:08.750
it has been unable
to recover for over a decade.

03:09.630 --> 03:11.150
Now it finally

03:11.870 --> 03:14.400
has a chance
to compete for Tribute Ink again,

03:14.590 --> 03:16.650
but we ran into the pine wilt disease.

03:16.910 --> 03:19.240
It is now a matter of life and death.

03:20.400 --> 03:22.710
The ink workshop needs someone

03:22.840 --> 03:24.370
who can convince everyone,

03:24.800 --> 03:26.060
who can manage things,

03:26.680 --> 03:27.870
and who can be trusted

03:27.870 --> 03:29.930
in order to stabilize the situation.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.190
Only then can I

03:31.430 --> 03:33.710
go into the mountains in peace
to find pine wood.

03:33.710 --> 03:34.710
Otherwise,

03:34.910 --> 03:37.000
the century-old foundation
of the Li family

03:37.000 --> 03:39.280
will be destroyed in our generation.

03:39.630 --> 03:41.000
Isn't that a sin?

03:42.079 --> 03:43.710
I know in your heart,

03:44.710 --> 03:46.190
your resentment toward the main family

03:46.190 --> 03:48.560
cannot be resolved overnight.

03:49.190 --> 03:51.030
When I return from finding pine wood,

03:51.030 --> 03:54.400
please, Zhen, give the main family and me

03:54.520 --> 03:55.910
a chance to make amends.

03:56.470 --> 03:57.590
Alright?

03:58.680 --> 04:00.190
And those ink-makers—

04:00.360 --> 04:02.840
ever since you left Li Ink,

04:03.430 --> 04:05.030
they have all come to realize it.

04:05.030 --> 04:09.030
They truly recognize your skill
in making ink.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.000
Look,

04:10.560 --> 04:12.430
this is a petition they wrote.

04:13.000 --> 04:14.600
They all hope you can go back.

04:17.240 --> 04:18.070
Zhen,

04:18.070 --> 04:20.390
I, an old man, am begging you like this.

04:21.430 --> 04:23.160
Can you help me?

04:32.470 --> 04:33.600
Sixth Grandfather,

04:34.270 --> 04:35.800
regarding today's matter,

04:37.120 --> 04:38.380
I cannot say yes to you.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.390
Please go back.

04:42.040 --> 04:42.950
Zhen.

04:52.430 --> 04:54.159
Take care, Sixth Grandfather.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.830
Sorry to bother you.

05:02.680 --> 05:03.870
Sorry to bother you.

05:38.830 --> 05:40.070
Seventh Old Madam.

05:40.560 --> 05:43.490
Our stored pine
is only enough to fulfill our orders.

05:43.560 --> 05:45.310
We really don't have any extra.

05:45.310 --> 05:46.040
I'm sorry.

05:46.040 --> 05:47.240
It's fine.

05:47.480 --> 05:48.880
Sorry for the intrusion.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.100
Please go back.

05:50.240 --> 05:51.100
Please go back.

05:55.240 --> 05:56.070
No need to see me out.

05:56.070 --> 05:57.930
No need to see me out, Manager Pan.

05:57.950 --> 05:59.010
Seventh Old Madam.

06:00.480 --> 06:01.480
I am really sorry.

06:03.680 --> 06:04.750
I understand.

06:06.120 --> 06:07.000
I understand.

06:07.800 --> 06:08.600
Go back.

06:10.040 --> 06:10.720
Go back.

06:32.510 --> 06:33.970
I am sorry, Seventh Old Madam.

06:33.970 --> 06:35.770
We really have no more pine wood.

06:36.190 --> 06:37.040
It's fine.

06:42.120 --> 06:42.920
Mother!

06:44.040 --> 06:44.800
Mother!

06:45.380 --> 06:47.510
I've been looking everywhere for you.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.560
I'm fine.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.000
I'm fine.

06:50.000 --> 06:50.720
Let's go home.

06:50.720 --> 06:51.270
Okay.

06:51.430 --> 06:52.159
It's just...

06:52.740 --> 06:54.370
It's just this cough.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.920
Why didn't you call me when you came out?

06:59.750 --> 07:02.430
I just wanted to look for it myself.

07:02.450 --> 07:03.190
I couldn't find you.

07:03.190 --> 07:05.000
Do you know how worried I was?

07:11.190 --> 07:12.680
Zhen! Zhen!

07:12.680 --> 07:14.210
Ms. Zhen is in the backyard.

07:14.670 --> 07:15.590
Zhen.

07:16.190 --> 07:17.120
Zhen, bad news.

07:17.120 --> 07:18.270
What's wrong, Hua'er?

07:18.270 --> 07:19.240
What's wrong?

07:19.240 --> 07:22.070
Seventh Grandmother
couldn't buy pine wood anywhere

07:22.070 --> 07:24.000
and fell ill after returning home.

07:45.360 --> 07:47.090
-Zhen.
-Seventh Grandmother.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.870
Why are you here?

07:49.510 --> 07:50.800
Help me up.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.430
Hurry, help me up.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.800
Take it easy.

08:01.160 --> 08:03.480
Seventh Grandmother, just lie down.

08:07.120 --> 08:10.430
Why are you here, Zhen?

08:11.830 --> 08:13.480
I heard you were sick,

08:14.120 --> 08:15.180
so I came to see you.

08:23.120 --> 08:24.360
That's better.

08:29.120 --> 08:30.720
Zhen,

08:30.720 --> 08:31.920
it's nothing serious.

08:31.920 --> 08:35.120
It's just a minor illness. I'm fine.

08:37.150 --> 08:38.409
Seventh Grandmother.

08:39.549 --> 08:42.240
I actually saw you
on Sibao Street yesterday.

08:44.870 --> 08:46.320
I saw everything.

08:46.720 --> 08:49.050
Although the pine wilt disease is urgent,

08:49.320 --> 08:50.550
you shouldn't

08:50.550 --> 08:52.280
neglect your health like this.

08:52.720 --> 08:54.000
You could have just

08:54.120 --> 08:56.120
let others handle buying pine wood.

08:56.290 --> 08:57.690
Why did you have to

08:57.720 --> 08:59.850
go begging from door to door yourself?

09:02.670 --> 09:05.870
Now, with the pine wilt disease,
pine wood is hard to find.

09:07.480 --> 09:08.670
You know that

09:09.120 --> 09:10.450
our Li family depends on

09:11.030 --> 09:13.750
pine soot ink
as the foundation of our livelihood.

09:13.750 --> 09:15.790
Why does our Li family

09:15.790 --> 09:17.510
have to face such a disaster?

09:18.670 --> 09:21.150
I couldn't just stand by and watch.

09:21.480 --> 09:24.200
Fortunately,
I discussed this with your grandfather

09:24.200 --> 09:27.480
and your Sixth Grandfather
the day before yesterday.

09:29.390 --> 09:30.910
Regarding the pine wood,

09:31.120 --> 09:34.510
we have found a solution.

09:35.440 --> 09:37.000
So, Zhen,

09:38.480 --> 09:41.320
don't worry about it anymore.

09:42.200 --> 09:45.150
You should now focus on

09:46.840 --> 09:50.080
protecting your New Li Ink Workshop.

09:51.390 --> 09:53.480
That is the top priority.

10:00.030 --> 10:02.390
Come, let me see you.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.200
You've lost weight.

10:04.240 --> 10:05.170
You really have.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.000
You must be

10:07.360 --> 10:09.840
exhausted from running the ink workshop.

10:10.030 --> 10:11.960
You don't eat or sleep well.

10:13.270 --> 10:15.240
It breaks my heart.

10:15.510 --> 10:16.380
Here's what you're gonna do.

10:16.380 --> 10:17.380
After you go back,

10:17.550 --> 10:20.440
ask your mother to make you some good food

10:20.510 --> 10:22.360
to nourish your body.

10:22.630 --> 10:24.270
To make our little Zhen

10:24.720 --> 10:26.240
strong

10:26.270 --> 10:27.360
and energetic.

10:28.120 --> 10:29.850
If you don't have enough money,

10:29.960 --> 10:31.840
I can give you some.

10:32.350 --> 10:33.020
What's wrong?

10:33.020 --> 10:34.540
Don't cry.

10:35.030 --> 10:36.690
Why are you crying? Don't cry.

10:38.030 --> 10:39.160
The money is enough.

10:39.600 --> 10:41.150
The money you gave me

10:41.150 --> 10:42.750
is more than enough to spend.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.320
Ever since

10:45.080 --> 10:48.600
the year you broke off your engagement,

10:50.150 --> 10:52.270
I've been quietly setting aside

10:52.510 --> 10:55.510
some private money for you every year.

10:57.150 --> 10:59.720
No one knows about this money.

10:59.910 --> 11:01.840
You can't even say a word

11:02.150 --> 11:04.790
to Hua'er.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.390
Understood?

11:08.320 --> 11:09.750
My little Zhen

11:11.320 --> 11:13.440
is like a little sapling.

11:14.510 --> 11:15.750
Now,

11:16.510 --> 11:18.840
you have already grown up.

11:21.440 --> 11:23.440
Whatever you want to do now,

11:24.550 --> 11:27.240
just do it.

11:29.080 --> 11:31.510
My wish is

11:33.790 --> 11:36.200
for you to do what you like.

11:37.270 --> 11:39.840
As long as you are happy,

11:42.120 --> 11:43.750
I...

11:44.270 --> 11:46.120
can rest easy.

11:54.600 --> 11:56.390
My Zhen.

13:00.270 --> 13:01.150
Sixth Grandfather,

13:01.150 --> 13:03.120
stop wandering around
in front of my ink workshop.

13:03.120 --> 13:06.150
People who don't know might think
you're here to collect a debt.

13:06.150 --> 13:07.030
Zhen.

13:09.390 --> 13:11.120
About what you asked me before,

13:12.670 --> 13:13.610
I accept.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.870
But there are a few things
I must say first.

13:19.200 --> 13:21.630
I'm only returning to Li Ink
to help manage it temporarily.

13:21.630 --> 13:23.050
Once you return from finding pine

13:23.050 --> 13:24.840
and resolving the pine wilt disease,

13:24.840 --> 13:27.300
I will still go back
to my New Li Ink Workshop.

13:27.550 --> 13:28.270
Also,

13:28.630 --> 13:30.960
I hope everyone at Li Ink
can work together

13:31.120 --> 13:32.600
to overcome the current difficulties.

13:32.600 --> 13:33.870
If I find

13:34.030 --> 13:35.910
anyone engaging in

13:35.910 --> 13:37.960
internal scheming,

13:38.320 --> 13:40.360
I will follow the workshop's rules

13:40.360 --> 13:41.820
and punish them severely.

13:41.960 --> 13:44.750
Don't blame me for being ruthless then.

13:45.630 --> 13:46.360
Alright.

13:47.790 --> 13:49.150
We'll do as you say.

13:53.320 --> 13:55.480
Then I will entrust the workshop...

13:56.240 --> 13:56.960
and the Sixth Branch

13:56.960 --> 13:58.240
to you.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.770
Thank you, my good granddaughter.

14:05.030 --> 14:06.080
Then I...

14:14.440 --> 14:15.030
Miss.

14:15.680 --> 14:17.740
Are you worried about your marriage?

14:17.910 --> 14:19.630
I can read your fate
with a single divination.

14:19.630 --> 14:21.630
I hope you find a good match soon.

14:21.840 --> 14:22.480
Zhengshen.

14:22.480 --> 14:23.030
Miss.

14:24.510 --> 14:25.320
Grandfather?

14:26.790 --> 14:28.150
What brings you here?

14:28.600 --> 14:29.910
I missed you.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.360
How's your business?

14:32.960 --> 14:33.910
I...

14:34.150 --> 14:36.870
I haven't met anyone destined yet today.

14:37.390 --> 14:38.870
Aren't you an immortal?

14:40.080 --> 14:41.750
Didn't you do a divination

14:42.320 --> 14:43.980
to see whether it's a good time

14:45.730 --> 14:47.800
to do business today?

14:48.390 --> 14:49.240
Grandfather.

14:49.630 --> 14:51.080
It's one thing
for others to make fun of me,

14:51.080 --> 14:52.610
but why are you doing it too?

14:52.630 --> 14:54.430
I was young and ignorant before.

14:54.440 --> 14:56.720
Now I'm just doing a little business.

14:57.270 --> 14:59.400
I have to make money to support myself.

15:01.720 --> 15:04.480
Alright,
let me be your first customer today.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.340
How about that?

15:05.440 --> 15:06.120
Really?

15:06.630 --> 15:08.480
Grandfather, take your pick.

15:09.630 --> 15:10.630
I'll take

15:10.910 --> 15:12.040
all of these things.

15:12.480 --> 15:13.150
Here,

15:13.750 --> 15:14.480
take this.

15:26.960 --> 15:27.760
Grandfather,

15:29.080 --> 15:31.740
did you come specifically
looking for me today?

15:32.430 --> 15:34.030
I'm going away for a few days.

15:34.080 --> 15:36.360
Before I come back,

15:36.600 --> 15:39.390
I want you to help
take care of the family.

15:40.720 --> 15:42.790
But I don't know how to make ink.

15:42.950 --> 15:44.120
You know that.

15:44.410 --> 15:46.720
Everyone in the family
says I'm irresponsible.

15:46.720 --> 15:48.030
How can I help?

15:48.440 --> 15:50.100
Did I say I want you to make ink?

15:51.670 --> 15:53.470
As for the ink workshop affairs,

15:53.840 --> 15:55.790
I've already entrusted them to Zhen.

15:55.790 --> 15:57.750
Right, then what else is there?

15:57.870 --> 15:58.790
There is.

16:00.840 --> 16:03.720
Family matters, and your father's affairs.

16:04.200 --> 16:06.150
You know your father's temper.

16:06.670 --> 16:08.870
I'm worried that after Zhen arrives,

16:09.150 --> 16:11.320
he won't give her peace.

16:11.840 --> 16:14.200
That's why I want you to watch him.

16:14.630 --> 16:16.230
Don't let him cause trouble.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.360
Let him help out if he can.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.640
If he can't, just don't do things

16:21.150 --> 16:23.750
that hurt others
without benefiting himself.

16:24.440 --> 16:26.510
That would only disappoint Zhen.

16:28.360 --> 16:29.270
Understand?

16:35.630 --> 16:36.430
Grandfather,

16:37.680 --> 16:39.080
can I ask you a question?

16:40.080 --> 16:40.670
Go ahead.

16:41.670 --> 16:43.150
Why did you come to me?

16:46.320 --> 16:47.980
In the Li family, besides you,

16:48.080 --> 16:49.200
who else can I find?

16:50.510 --> 16:51.310
Grandfather.

16:51.440 --> 16:53.550
I thought you finally realized

16:53.590 --> 16:55.920
that I'm the kind of person who can

16:56.360 --> 16:58.510
step up in critical moments.

16:58.870 --> 16:59.840
What a good grandson.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.570
Come, let me show you some love.

17:02.120 --> 17:03.080
So many people are here.

17:03.080 --> 17:04.440
So many people are here.

17:04.460 --> 17:05.790
Alright, pack up your things.

17:05.790 --> 17:07.000
I will treat you to something good.

17:07.000 --> 17:07.530
Let's go.

17:07.680 --> 17:09.240
Okay. Wait for me.

17:25.270 --> 17:26.530
Seventh Grandmother.

17:27.550 --> 17:28.510
Sixth Grandfather.

17:28.510 --> 17:29.680
Zhen,

17:29.960 --> 17:32.110
it seems your Sixth Grandfather
is the only one

17:32.110 --> 17:33.730
who could persuade you to come back.

17:33.730 --> 17:36.710
I felt better as soon as I heard
you were coming back.

17:36.750 --> 17:37.320
Come.

17:40.920 --> 17:42.180
Seventh Grandmother.

17:44.310 --> 17:45.830
You came just in time.

17:47.550 --> 17:49.210
Master Qi is very thoughtful.

17:49.310 --> 17:52.240
He's been helping your Sixth Grandfather
prepare to go into the mountains.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.200
You see,

17:53.340 --> 17:57.050
he also took the trouble
to find these hunters.

17:57.750 --> 18:00.000
They know the roads of Mount Huang best.

18:00.200 --> 18:02.510
They can act as guides
and help carry things.

18:02.510 --> 18:04.270
They will follow instructions
along the way.

18:04.270 --> 18:06.440
And that Mr. Xiao.

18:06.790 --> 18:08.440
He is very skilled in martial arts

18:08.440 --> 18:10.160
in the military.

18:10.550 --> 18:13.270
Master Qi has sent his most capable man

18:13.310 --> 18:16.310
to help your Sixth Grandfather
go into the mountains.

18:16.550 --> 18:18.440
If they encounter any wild animals,

18:18.440 --> 18:20.720
he can show off his skills.

18:21.550 --> 18:23.960
Master Qi is indeed
a shareholder of Li Ink.

18:24.000 --> 18:26.330
He takes responsibility for everything.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.400
Old Madam.

18:28.640 --> 18:31.310
The truly thoughtful one is Miss Li Zhen.

18:32.030 --> 18:34.960
She came to my door
to ask me to lend her some men.

18:35.510 --> 18:37.270
Zhen is indeed thoughtful.

18:37.550 --> 18:39.590
Zhen, you...

18:39.750 --> 18:41.010
Seventh Grandmother,

18:41.030 --> 18:43.160
the one who really helped is Master Qi.

18:43.400 --> 18:44.750
We should thank him.

18:50.030 --> 18:52.110
Thank you again, Master Qi.

18:52.480 --> 18:54.610
Thank you for your trouble, Master Qi.

18:55.590 --> 18:57.200
Old Madam, Sixth Master Li,

18:57.310 --> 18:58.960
please don't be so polite.

19:08.970 --> 19:10.180
[Li Ink]

19:20.240 --> 19:21.000
Everyone.

19:21.680 --> 19:24.440
I have been entrusted by Sixth Grandfather
to help the ink workshop.

19:24.440 --> 19:26.110
I'm sure you all know by now.

19:26.440 --> 19:28.030
I was here a while ago,

19:28.350 --> 19:29.550
but at that time,

19:29.790 --> 19:31.640
I was an ink maker hired by Li Ink.

19:32.070 --> 19:34.510
This time it's different.

19:34.790 --> 19:36.850
Sixth Grandfather has gone into
the mountain to find pine wood.

19:36.850 --> 19:38.760
We must live up to his efforts.

19:40.400 --> 19:42.640
As for the current situation of Li Ink,

19:42.920 --> 19:44.720
you must have known about it.

19:45.240 --> 19:47.160
First, the pine wilt disease
has broken out.

19:47.160 --> 19:49.160
Second, the Tribute Ink selection
is imminent.

19:49.160 --> 19:50.680
Two things are happening at the same time,

19:50.680 --> 19:52.160
which makes it quite difficult.

19:52.160 --> 19:53.640
If we want to get through this,

19:53.640 --> 19:56.240
we will rely on the cooperation
of the whole ink workshop,

19:56.240 --> 19:59.640
that is, the support and solidarity
of all the brothers here.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.240
As the saying goes,

20:06.880 --> 20:10.030
"Troops have no fixed strategy,
just as water has no constant shape."

20:10.030 --> 20:12.720
We must be flexible where we need to be.

20:13.310 --> 20:16.440
So today I will offer my humble thoughts

20:16.510 --> 20:18.030
and share two of my ideas.

20:19.030 --> 20:19.790
First,

20:20.590 --> 20:23.590
the Li family
must win the Tribute Ink rights.

20:23.960 --> 20:26.510
Uncle Jingdong has poured his heart
and soul into developing new ink,

20:26.510 --> 20:28.000
so everything he needs

20:28.030 --> 20:30.030
must be prepared in full.

20:30.270 --> 20:32.400
Manager Shao has checked the roster.

20:32.750 --> 20:36.590
The personnel and materials listed
must be used exclusively for this task

20:36.590 --> 20:37.990
and must not be diverted.

20:38.160 --> 20:40.510
Second, the pine wilt disease
has broken out.

20:40.510 --> 20:42.240
Pine wood has become a rarity.

20:42.750 --> 20:45.270
Our warehouse stock is limited,

20:45.510 --> 20:47.240
and we still have to handle
the signed orders

20:47.240 --> 20:48.880
for the coming months.

20:49.110 --> 20:51.270
We need to increase income
and reduce expenditure.

20:51.270 --> 20:53.440
From now on, when making lampblack,

20:53.510 --> 20:56.640
every piece of pine wood
must be handled with great care.

21:02.750 --> 21:05.350
This is your lampblack-making record
for this month.

21:05.350 --> 21:08.210
I've looked at it
and found something interesting.

21:09.880 --> 21:11.070
Who is Qi Donghai?

21:12.400 --> 21:13.510
Who is Qi Donghai?

21:14.160 --> 21:14.960
I...

21:15.350 --> 21:16.400
I am.

21:18.400 --> 21:20.720
On average, 8 out of every 10 portions
of pine soot lampblack you made

21:20.720 --> 21:22.160
are of good quality.

21:22.440 --> 21:24.270
That far exceeds the other ink-makers.

21:24.270 --> 21:26.330
It shows you've put in a lot of effort.

21:27.070 --> 21:28.750
You are a third-class ink-maker.

21:28.750 --> 21:31.230
Today, I promote you
to a second-class ink-maker.

21:31.230 --> 21:32.360
Your pay is doubled.

21:32.380 --> 21:34.670
Thank you, Miss Li Zhen.

21:35.000 --> 21:35.660
Second-class?

21:35.660 --> 21:36.490
Why?

21:36.960 --> 21:38.160
Keep up the good work.

21:41.620 --> 21:43.880
Miss Li Zhen,
I'm afraid this is inappropriate.

21:43.880 --> 21:44.960
According to the rules
of the ink workshop,

21:44.960 --> 21:47.110
a third-class ink-maker
needs at least 2 years

21:47.110 --> 21:49.720
to be promoted to second-class
after passing the assessment.

21:49.720 --> 21:51.240
Qi Donghai has only been making lampblack

21:51.240 --> 21:52.960
in the workshop for just a year.

21:52.960 --> 21:53.830
Well...

21:55.270 --> 21:56.310
Manager Shao,

21:56.640 --> 21:58.680
rules exist for a reason.

21:59.000 --> 22:00.920
But if we stick rigidly to the rules,

22:00.920 --> 22:03.220
they become a shackle.

22:05.030 --> 22:06.790
Now that the pine
wilt disease has broken out,

22:06.790 --> 22:08.440
if everyone wastes
one less bowl of lampblack,

22:08.440 --> 22:10.640
we can save one more piece of pine wood.

22:10.960 --> 22:12.880
Our shipments will be guaranteed,

22:12.880 --> 22:15.000
and everyone's jobs will be secure!

22:17.510 --> 22:18.310
That makes sense.

22:18.310 --> 22:19.710
That sounds reasonable.

22:23.160 --> 22:24.160
I hereby announce

22:24.590 --> 22:26.240
that starting today, our ink workshop

22:26.240 --> 22:28.700
will adopt a flexible approach
to staffing.

22:28.750 --> 22:32.150
No matter who you are or which stage
of production you work in,

22:32.150 --> 22:33.920
as long as you can achieve
an 80% pass rate

22:33.920 --> 22:35.720
like Qi Donghai,

22:35.920 --> 22:37.400
you will be promoted one level,

22:37.400 --> 22:38.880
regardless of seniority,

22:39.030 --> 22:40.960
and receive the wages you deserve.

22:41.310 --> 22:44.310
I hope everyone
will put in more effort and research

22:44.420 --> 22:47.030
so that we can overcome the current
difficulties of Li Ink together.

22:47.030 --> 22:48.070
Really?

22:48.550 --> 22:50.080
Then we can make more money!

22:50.200 --> 22:51.330
This is a good thing!

22:52.110 --> 22:53.000
Miss Li Zhen,

22:53.200 --> 22:54.800
I misunderstood you before.

22:55.000 --> 22:56.330
I apologize to you here.

22:56.510 --> 22:57.830
Yes, Miss Li Zhen.

22:58.070 --> 23:00.400
I was blind and failed to see the truth.

23:01.030 --> 23:02.160
I've long wanted

23:02.510 --> 23:03.720
to apologize as well.

23:04.030 --> 23:06.510
From now on, whatever you instruct,

23:06.880 --> 23:08.140
I will obey without question.

23:08.140 --> 23:10.590
Yes, we'll all listen to you.

24:43.680 --> 24:44.440
Miss Li Zhen,

24:44.590 --> 24:46.000
what can I do for you?

24:46.110 --> 24:48.160
Manager Shao, no need for formalities.

24:48.160 --> 24:50.960
I asked you here to discuss two things.

24:51.240 --> 24:52.030
Miss Li Zhen,

24:52.200 --> 24:54.070
you are now the acting manager
of the ink workshop.

24:54.070 --> 24:56.470
Please feel free to give any instructions.

24:57.790 --> 24:59.310
I noticed that we previously

24:59.310 --> 25:01.880
had a large backlog
of orders for pine soot ink.

25:01.880 --> 25:03.400
Although the new rules

25:03.450 --> 25:05.000
have improved the pass rate,

25:05.000 --> 25:06.830
it is not a long-term solution.

25:07.060 --> 25:08.220
So I was thinking—

25:08.600 --> 25:10.110
could you reach out to some of our

25:10.110 --> 25:12.400
long-standing ink merchants

25:12.420 --> 25:13.420
and persuade them

25:13.590 --> 25:15.590
to switch part of
their pine soot ink orders

25:15.590 --> 25:17.250
to lacquer-soot ink instead?

25:17.480 --> 25:19.270
That's actually a good idea.

25:19.400 --> 25:21.510
Leave this to me.

25:21.720 --> 25:24.920
Furthermore,
I checked the accounts recently

25:25.510 --> 25:27.310
and found the raw lacquer supply
has been declining

25:27.310 --> 25:28.680
over the past two months.

25:28.680 --> 25:32.410
Has the Sixth Branch reduced
its raw lacquer production recently?

25:35.750 --> 25:37.160
I haven't heard

25:37.200 --> 25:40.310
Miss Chunhua send anyone
to report a drop in production.

25:40.310 --> 25:42.310
If the raw lacquer supply can't keep up,

25:42.310 --> 25:43.440
these orders

25:43.440 --> 25:45.160
risk falling through on both ends.

25:45.160 --> 25:47.240
We might end up losing everything

25:47.270 --> 25:48.480
and doing more harm than good.

25:48.480 --> 25:50.540
We would even face a massive penalty.

25:51.240 --> 25:52.000
Well,

25:52.480 --> 25:55.280
should I send someone
to investigate thoroughly?

25:56.550 --> 25:58.210
We shouldn't let this get out.

25:58.400 --> 25:59.920
If those ink merchants

25:59.960 --> 26:01.700
find out we are short on raw materials,

26:01.700 --> 26:04.030
they will inevitably lose trust in Li Ink.

26:04.270 --> 26:07.070
Then what should we do
about the raw lacquer?

26:08.310 --> 26:11.030
Manager Shao, please keep an eye
on the ink workshop's production.

26:11.030 --> 26:13.200
I'll handle the raw lacquer issue.

26:14.070 --> 26:16.160
Then I'll leave it to you, Miss Li Zhen.

26:16.160 --> 26:17.560
Thank you, Manager Shao.

26:40.030 --> 26:41.630
Wait for me, Uncle Jingdong.

26:44.880 --> 26:45.810
Uncle Jingdong,

26:45.830 --> 26:47.890
I have something to discuss with you.

26:48.030 --> 26:48.790
Go ahead.

26:49.350 --> 26:50.170
Here is the thing.

26:50.170 --> 26:51.640
For the ink workshop's revenue,

26:51.640 --> 26:53.630
I have converted some pine soot ink orders

26:53.630 --> 26:56.090
into lacquer-soot ink orders
at a discount.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.110
Li Zhen,

26:58.890 --> 27:01.690
since my father
entrusted the ink workshop to you,

27:02.310 --> 27:04.000
you can make the decisions yourself.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.440
No need to tell me.

27:06.550 --> 27:07.350
The Sixth Branch has always

27:07.350 --> 27:09.310
been responsible
for supplying raw lacquer.

27:09.310 --> 27:11.270
Since the future demand
for raw lacquer will only increase,

27:11.270 --> 27:13.270
I would like to ask for your help
to coordinate

27:13.270 --> 27:14.680
and increase its supply

27:14.720 --> 27:17.120
to support Li Ink through this difficulty.

27:19.070 --> 27:20.110
What do you mean?

27:21.000 --> 27:22.880
Are you afraid
I'll reduce your raw lacquer supply

27:22.880 --> 27:24.680
and deliberately make things difficult
for you?

27:24.680 --> 27:25.510
Li Zhen.

27:25.830 --> 27:27.590
This is a very good year,

27:27.720 --> 27:30.000
and the yield of raw lacquer is abundant.

27:36.280 --> 27:38.760
I might as well make it clearer.

27:38.790 --> 27:39.510
Li Zhen.

27:40.160 --> 27:43.180
No matter how dissatisfied I am
with your Eighth Branch,

27:43.180 --> 27:45.640
I will not ruin Li Ink's business.

27:46.000 --> 27:49.070
So don't assume

27:49.110 --> 27:50.790
the worst of me.

28:02.160 --> 28:04.160
It seems he doesn't know the reason.

28:05.270 --> 28:06.440
Aunt Chunhua.

28:08.170 --> 28:09.230
Zhen, you're here.

28:09.830 --> 28:10.830
Run.

28:11.640 --> 28:12.750
Zhen!

28:12.920 --> 28:14.920
Play horseback riding with me.

28:15.000 --> 28:17.070
Father hasn't been home for a long time.

28:17.070 --> 28:19.030
No one plays with me.

28:19.550 --> 28:21.880
Okay, I'll play with you in a bit,
alright?

28:21.880 --> 28:22.480
Okay.

28:22.920 --> 28:25.000
Aunt, for the opening
of the New Li Ink Workshop,

28:25.000 --> 28:26.340
someone brought us
a spotted pig as a gift.

28:26.340 --> 28:28.490
My mother made some cured pork ribs.

28:28.960 --> 28:30.590
She asked me
to bring some over for you and Run

28:30.590 --> 28:31.480
to try.

28:32.510 --> 28:33.350
Come, Zhen.

28:33.550 --> 28:34.400
Sit here.

28:39.270 --> 28:40.240
Thank you, Aunt.

28:42.070 --> 28:42.790
Aunt,

28:42.960 --> 28:44.070
is Uncle not here?

28:44.830 --> 28:46.960
Decai said he was going to Suzhou
to deliver goods.

28:46.960 --> 28:49.030
He won't be back for half a month.

28:49.310 --> 28:49.960
I see.

28:52.680 --> 28:55.480
How have things been at the ink workshop
these days?

28:55.480 --> 28:56.960
My brother has always been very rigid.

28:56.960 --> 28:58.830
If he said anything unpleasant,

28:58.830 --> 29:00.110
please don't take it to heart.

29:00.110 --> 29:01.880
No, everything is fine.

29:01.880 --> 29:02.940
Don't worry, Aunt.

29:04.350 --> 29:05.510
I actually came here this time

29:05.510 --> 29:07.480
for the raw lacquer.

29:07.970 --> 29:09.550
I checked the registration ledger

29:09.550 --> 29:12.110
and found that the intake of raw lacquer
over the past 6 months

29:12.110 --> 29:13.160
has decreased.

29:13.320 --> 29:15.790
And Uncle Jingdong
is busy developing Tribute Ink,

29:15.790 --> 29:17.270
so he has no time to manage this.

29:17.270 --> 29:19.640
I had no choice
but to come to you for help.

29:21.270 --> 29:22.160
Zhen.

29:22.920 --> 29:24.850
Don't worry about the raw lacquer.

29:25.350 --> 29:27.160
I will definitely cooperate in every way.

29:27.160 --> 29:28.200
It's just that...

29:29.070 --> 29:30.270
To tell you the truth,

29:30.790 --> 29:33.400
there are indeed some special circumstances
regarding this matter.

29:33.400 --> 29:34.960
Previously, our Li Ink Workshop

29:34.960 --> 29:36.690
mostly produced pine soot ink.

29:36.790 --> 29:39.450
The usage of raw lacquer
was actually not large.

29:39.650 --> 29:41.650
There was some surplus every month.

29:42.510 --> 29:45.590
In order to bring more income
to the family,

29:46.200 --> 29:48.350
six months ago, I took it upon myself

29:48.790 --> 29:51.030
to sell some to outside merchants.

29:54.510 --> 29:57.110
Aunt, which merchants did you sell it to?

29:57.240 --> 29:58.550
Can I have a look?

29:59.200 --> 29:59.920
Okay.

30:01.210 --> 30:02.780
Zhen, sit down first.

30:14.160 --> 30:14.960
Take a look.

30:16.200 --> 30:19.060
I've registered
every single transaction in here.

30:48.510 --> 30:49.350
Aunt,

30:49.920 --> 30:53.640
the ink workshop is in urgent need
of a large amount of raw lacquer recently.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.590
Could you think of a way

30:55.960 --> 30:58.310
to speak with some of the merchants here

30:58.480 --> 31:00.280
and ask them to return some of it?

31:01.400 --> 31:04.720
Right now, we'll take
however much we can scrape together.

31:06.830 --> 31:09.400
Business values integrity the most.

31:10.030 --> 31:11.560
I'm afraid this won't work.

31:13.880 --> 31:14.640
Yes.

31:15.270 --> 31:16.160
I know.

31:16.830 --> 31:19.110
But this is for the livelihood of Li Ink.

31:21.400 --> 31:22.200
Aunt.

31:23.070 --> 31:25.600
If it's inconvenient
for you to come forward,

31:25.830 --> 31:27.510
let me be the bad guy.

31:27.720 --> 31:29.240
How about I go talk to them?

31:30.830 --> 31:32.270
The ink workshop has a lot of affairs.

31:32.270 --> 31:33.640
You are already so busy.

31:34.000 --> 31:36.030
Let me handle this matter.

31:36.830 --> 31:38.070
Zhen, don't worry.

31:38.920 --> 31:41.350
These raw lacquer merchants
are all regular customers.

31:41.350 --> 31:43.550
We can always call in some favors.

31:45.030 --> 31:46.880
Then I'll leave it to you, Aunt.

31:48.240 --> 31:50.310
I won't disturb you anymore.
I'll take my leave.

31:50.310 --> 31:51.030
Okay.

31:52.110 --> 31:53.490
Please go back inside, Aunt.

31:53.490 --> 31:54.180
Take care.

32:16.880 --> 32:18.240
Here are last month's accounts.

32:18.240 --> 32:19.920
Find someone to send them to my sister

32:19.920 --> 32:20.920
for her to review.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.770
Okay, Master. Don't worry.

32:33.640 --> 32:34.370
Miss Li Zhen.

32:34.830 --> 32:35.560
Miss Li Zhen,

32:35.790 --> 32:36.880
the Master is inside.

32:36.880 --> 32:37.350
Thank you.

32:37.350 --> 32:37.830
Please.

32:41.310 --> 32:42.160
Master Qi.

32:43.830 --> 32:44.510
Zhen?

32:46.240 --> 32:47.440
What brings you here?

32:47.640 --> 32:49.590
I was passing by,
so I dropped in to see you

32:49.590 --> 32:50.920
and ask for a cup of tea.

32:51.030 --> 32:52.270
Also, I wanted to ask

32:52.270 --> 32:53.920
if you know any raw lacquer merchants

32:53.920 --> 32:55.070
that you could introduce to me.

32:55.070 --> 32:55.830
No problem.

32:55.960 --> 32:57.020
Please have a seat.

32:58.000 --> 32:58.880
Mr. He.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.720
Brew some of the newly arrived tea.

33:00.720 --> 33:01.550
Right away.

33:04.240 --> 33:04.790
Zhen.

33:05.630 --> 33:07.040
I do know a few

33:07.060 --> 33:08.590
raw lacquer merchants.

33:08.880 --> 33:10.720
Would you like to meet them at a teahouse

33:10.720 --> 33:12.310
or a restaurant?

33:13.160 --> 33:13.830
I just returned to Li...

33:13.830 --> 33:14.680
Sir,

33:14.720 --> 33:17.310
please see how much this hairpin
can be pawned for.

33:17.310 --> 33:18.270
Okay.

33:20.400 --> 33:21.200
What's wrong?

33:26.830 --> 33:28.310
Thirty taels for pawning.

33:28.480 --> 33:29.680
Sixty taels for selling.

33:29.680 --> 33:31.940
Do you want to pawn it
or sell it outright?

33:35.590 --> 33:36.590
Sell it outright.

33:36.830 --> 33:38.000
One gold hairpin!

33:38.030 --> 33:39.640
Sold outright for 60 taels!

33:40.590 --> 33:41.590
Here is the money.

33:42.200 --> 33:42.920
Keep it.

33:42.960 --> 33:43.680
Thank you.

33:43.920 --> 33:44.590
Take care.

33:45.350 --> 33:46.240
Take care.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.160
Mr. He.

33:53.920 --> 33:55.510
Let me see the item

33:55.510 --> 33:56.770
that lady just pawned.

33:58.550 --> 33:59.150
It's okay.

34:01.270 --> 34:02.030
Here you go.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.550
Sir.

34:14.190 --> 34:14.920
Sir.

34:15.110 --> 34:16.510
Do you have raw lacquer left?

34:16.510 --> 34:18.760
It was sold out long ago.

34:27.880 --> 34:30.880
In order to bring more income
to the family,

34:31.590 --> 34:33.920
6 months ago, I took it upon myself

34:33.940 --> 34:36.420
to sell some to outside merchants.

34:36.480 --> 34:37.550
I've registered

34:37.550 --> 34:39.480
every single transaction in here.

34:40.840 --> 34:41.550
Aunt,

34:41.710 --> 34:42.840
is Uncle not here?

34:43.500 --> 34:45.710
Decai said he was going to Suzhou
to deliver goods.

34:45.710 --> 34:47.670
He won't be back for half a month.

34:52.230 --> 34:53.230
Zhengshen,

34:53.840 --> 34:55.639
how did you pop up out of nowhere?

34:56.230 --> 34:58.590
You look so worried. What's the matter?

34:58.670 --> 34:59.480
Tell me.

34:59.660 --> 35:00.760
Let me help you.

35:01.280 --> 35:04.110
I wouldn't dare trouble
a real immortal like you.

35:06.070 --> 35:06.920
Zhen,

35:07.150 --> 35:08.670
you're making fun of me.

35:09.400 --> 35:10.360
I know.

35:10.550 --> 35:12.000
No one in this family believes me.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.550
They think I just seek immortality all day

35:13.550 --> 35:14.760
and neglect my proper duties.

35:14.760 --> 35:16.230
But everything I do

35:16.360 --> 35:18.190
is to keep the Li family safe.

35:18.710 --> 35:20.190
Grandfather, for the sake of the family,

35:20.190 --> 35:21.710
risked his life going into the mountains.

35:21.710 --> 35:22.920
And Father

35:23.000 --> 35:25.030
has been developing Tribute Ink
day and night.

35:25.030 --> 35:27.710
I should also contribute to this family

35:28.070 --> 35:31.010
by taking off my Taoist robe
and entering the secular world to help.

35:31.010 --> 35:32.630
If you ever need my help in the future,

35:32.630 --> 35:33.630
just let me know.

35:34.840 --> 35:36.550
Just look at it as helping me out.

35:36.550 --> 35:39.190
Killing two birds with one stone—
wouldn't that be perfect?

35:39.190 --> 35:43.110
Zhengshen,
I happen to have something right now

35:43.280 --> 35:44.740
that I need your help with.

35:45.030 --> 35:45.880
What is it?

35:46.920 --> 35:48.510
I would like to trouble you

35:48.630 --> 35:50.290
to make a trip to Suzhou for me.

35:51.450 --> 35:52.340
Suzhou?

35:55.630 --> 35:58.360
Zhen, you are truly a living immortal.

35:59.280 --> 36:02.070
Those merchants Aunt gave us are all fake.

36:02.110 --> 36:03.370
They don't even exist.

36:04.070 --> 36:05.280
And I also found out

36:05.730 --> 36:07.540
that my uncle, Li Decai,

36:08.440 --> 36:10.190
who said he went to deliver goods
to Suzhou,

36:10.190 --> 36:12.630
is actually privately selling
at a low price

36:12.630 --> 36:14.230
our Li family's raw lacquer.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.840
The buyer said

36:16.190 --> 36:18.000
without the connection to Mrs. Su,

36:18.000 --> 36:20.400
ordinary people
wouldn't be able to buy it.

36:20.550 --> 36:21.320
Mrs. Su?

36:22.000 --> 36:23.280
Who is Mrs. Su?

36:24.550 --> 36:26.920
She's the mistress
Li Decai keeps in Suzhou.

36:26.920 --> 36:28.150
They even have a child.

36:28.150 --> 36:30.360
He also owes a lot of money outside.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.400
Zhengshen,

36:32.880 --> 36:35.190
are you sure you got all this right?

36:35.280 --> 36:36.440
Absolutely sure.

36:36.710 --> 36:38.480
If you hadn't repeatedly warned me

36:38.480 --> 36:39.840
not to act rashly,

36:40.440 --> 36:42.900
I would have tied him up
and brought him back.

36:45.070 --> 36:47.400
No, I have to tell my father about this

36:47.400 --> 36:48.440
and let him uphold justice.

36:48.440 --> 36:49.480
Come back!

36:49.630 --> 36:51.510
Don't you know your father's temper?

36:51.510 --> 36:53.840
Why do you think I asked you to go
to Suzhou and not someone else?

36:53.840 --> 36:55.970
This matter shouldn't be made public.

36:57.360 --> 36:59.290
Then what do you think we should do?

37:00.880 --> 37:02.740
Give me some time to think of a way.

37:03.960 --> 37:04.880
Remember,

37:05.190 --> 37:07.190
this is strictly between you and me.

37:07.230 --> 37:08.560
Don't tell anyone else.

37:10.280 --> 37:10.960
Also,

37:11.530 --> 37:12.480
over in Suzhou,

37:12.590 --> 37:14.030
did you arrange for someone
to keep an eye on him?

37:14.030 --> 37:15.840
Don't worry. It's all arranged.

37:19.440 --> 37:21.360
That ungrateful thing!

37:25.960 --> 37:27.070
Run.

37:27.960 --> 37:29.150
Zhen.

37:30.330 --> 37:31.500
Zhen.

37:32.550 --> 37:35.440
Run, why aren't you riding a horse today?

37:36.230 --> 37:38.070
Father isn't here. It's not fun.

37:38.320 --> 37:39.920
Mother, come out!

37:40.840 --> 37:41.920
-Zhen.
-Zhen is here.

37:41.920 --> 37:42.440
Aunt.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.510
Are you looking for me?

37:43.510 --> 37:44.880
It's really a bad time.

37:45.030 --> 37:46.560
It's Run's birthday today.

37:46.630 --> 37:47.550
His father is not around.

37:47.550 --> 37:49.960
I was just about
to take him to pick persimmons.

37:49.960 --> 37:50.710
Come on, Run.

37:50.840 --> 37:52.230
It's your birthday today?

37:52.230 --> 37:53.070
That's perfect.

37:53.070 --> 37:55.030
How about I pick persimmons with you?

37:55.030 --> 37:55.590
Alright!

37:55.590 --> 37:56.650
Come, hold my hand.

37:56.880 --> 37:57.740
Let's go, Aunt.

38:03.710 --> 38:05.400
Mother, I want to do it myself.

38:05.510 --> 38:07.150
Does Father like softer persimmons,

38:07.150 --> 38:08.760
or harder ones?

38:08.980 --> 38:11.000
Father hasn't been home for a long time.

38:11.000 --> 38:13.070
When exactly is he coming back?

38:13.360 --> 38:16.560
He promised to come back
to celebrate my birthday with me.

38:18.000 --> 38:20.590
Once we finish picking these persimmons,

38:20.630 --> 38:22.630
your father will be almost home.

38:22.840 --> 38:23.510
Run,

38:23.670 --> 38:26.180
How about I help you pick them?

38:26.230 --> 38:26.480
Okay.

38:26.480 --> 38:28.070
If I hold you and push like this,

38:28.070 --> 38:30.320
it counts as you picking
the persimmon yourself, okay?

38:30.320 --> 38:30.590
Okay.

38:30.590 --> 38:31.050
Come on.

38:31.960 --> 38:33.710
Look, it fell down.

38:34.110 --> 38:35.110
Run is so great.

38:35.800 --> 38:37.870
Zhen, you're so amazing.

38:38.920 --> 38:40.190
Do you believe me?

38:40.280 --> 38:43.410
In a couple of days,
your father will definitely be back.

38:46.940 --> 38:48.320
Pick some soft ones first.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.360
Run likes them.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.070
These hard ones

38:52.150 --> 38:54.840
will be ripe just in time
for Decai's return.

39:00.670 --> 39:02.200
Aunt, do you still remember

39:02.480 --> 39:04.680
what kind of persimmons you like to eat?

39:09.630 --> 39:10.760
A while ago,

39:11.070 --> 39:13.070
I asked Zhengshen to go to Suzhou.

39:15.360 --> 39:16.780
He found out some things.

39:24.400 --> 39:25.440
Some things

39:26.030 --> 39:27.630
you can hide from for a while,

39:28.360 --> 39:29.550
but not forever.

39:30.880 --> 39:32.280
If it comes to light,

39:32.430 --> 39:34.400
you will displease both sides,

39:34.630 --> 39:36.960
and you will be the one
to suffer in the end.

39:37.800 --> 39:38.590
Aunt,

39:39.110 --> 39:40.770
based on what I know about you,

39:41.190 --> 39:43.790
you wouldn't do anything
to harm the Li family.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.670
But can you tell me

39:46.800 --> 39:49.460
why you've been helping Li Decai
cook the books?

39:58.840 --> 39:59.590
Aunt,

40:00.400 --> 40:01.400
do you know

40:02.370 --> 40:04.370
that he has a mistress outside?

40:05.480 --> 40:07.190
Today is Run's birthday.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.230
As his father,

40:09.510 --> 40:11.590
he is wrapped up
in the arms of another woman,

40:11.590 --> 40:14.030
without a care for you and your son,

40:14.360 --> 40:16.220
yet you are still thinking of him.

40:24.060 --> 40:25.510
Run looks up to

40:26.800 --> 40:28.110
his father.

40:29.480 --> 40:32.210
I can't let him lose his father
at such a young age.

40:34.000 --> 40:36.130
I knew he had a mistress a long time ago.

40:36.480 --> 40:37.880
But for Run's sake,

40:38.440 --> 40:40.170
this family cannot fall apart.

40:42.630 --> 40:44.230
As long as I don't bring it up,

40:45.280 --> 40:47.630
at least he will come back to Run,

40:48.670 --> 40:51.070
and I can pretend nothing ever happened.

41:00.880 --> 41:01.760
Zhen,

41:03.690 --> 41:05.030
I am begging you,

41:05.880 --> 41:07.680
don't make a big deal out of this.

41:09.800 --> 41:12.630
Please indulge my selfishness
just this once.

41:17.320 --> 41:19.250
Every family has its own problems.

41:20.110 --> 41:21.400
In this matter,

41:22.480 --> 41:25.140
I really have no right
to say these things to you.

41:26.280 --> 41:28.610
But the Li family's disaster is imminent,

41:29.230 --> 41:31.690
and I must give the Li family
an explanation.

41:36.550 --> 41:39.030
I can choose not to blow this
out of proportion,

41:39.030 --> 41:41.430
but you must also agree
to a few conditions.

41:44.230 --> 41:44.880
First,

41:45.230 --> 41:47.440
no more selling raw lacquer on the sly.

41:47.760 --> 41:50.020
If it happens again, I won't tolerate it.

41:53.400 --> 41:54.110
Second,

41:54.510 --> 41:56.770
you can no longer help him cook the books.

41:57.480 --> 41:59.030
Even for Run's sake,

41:59.310 --> 42:01.310
you must not get yourself involved.

42:01.590 --> 42:02.990
Do you understand, Aunt?

42:07.960 --> 42:09.960
Thank you, Zhen.

42:14.800 --> 42:18.530
[Wang Residence, Suzhou]

42:20.510 --> 42:21.190
Zhen,

42:21.840 --> 42:22.770
it's right here.

42:23.190 --> 42:24.230
Wang Residence?

42:26.030 --> 42:27.400
What a Wang Residence.

42:32.630 --> 42:33.840
You guys go to the back door

42:33.840 --> 42:34.920
and open the door for me.

42:34.920 --> 42:35.440
Yes.

42:53.000 --> 42:54.460
-Who are you?
-Who are you?

42:54.510 --> 42:54.960
Come out!

42:54.960 --> 42:55.480
Master!

42:55.480 --> 42:58.550
How dare you break into a private house?
Is there any law?

42:58.550 --> 42:59.670
Mr. Wang,

42:59.920 --> 43:01.720
look how high and mighty you are.

43:02.370 --> 43:03.900
[Su Yunniang, Li Decai's mistress]

43:04.070 --> 43:04.920
Zhen?
